updates to our privacy policy and t&cs
your privacy has always been very important to us. to reflect the new guidelines of the upcoming general data protection regulation (gdpr), we've updated our privacy policy and t&cs so they are easier to understand.
please take a moment to read through these documents and the options you have related to the data you share with us.
by continuing to use scooploop, you acknowledge you've read the privacy policy and agree to our terms and conditions.
if you would like to delete your account, please click here.
you are in control of your settings, and you can change these at any time by visiting your settings.
you also have control of which emails you receive from scooploop. you can find all of your options here.
by default, you will receive a daily summary email containing new posts, events, comments and reviews in your area on scooploop. you have the option to receive these weekly, or to turn them off completely. to amend your daily summary email settings, please visit your settings
if you have amended your settings in the past, you do not need to do this again.
